WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:03.976
Pika!

00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:46.016
Brav!

00:00:50.988 --> 00:00:53.388
- Swan, Swanna!
- Fez!

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.127
Do you think you
can keep up with me?

00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:02.028
- Swellow!
- Staraptor!

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.696
Unfezant!

00:01:03.698 --> 00:01:05.230
Swanna!

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:23.379
This way.

00:01:23.381 --> 00:01:25.047
Follow my lead!

00:01:39.729 --> 00:01:41.462
I'm going
to speed up!

00:01:47.068 --> 00:01:50.069
I want to challenge the
boundaries of my power.

00:01:50.071 --> 00:01:51.403
I'll go on ahead!

00:01:56.276 --> 00:01:58.409
Beyond the limit!

00:02:05.217 --> 00:02:07.350
Just past there.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.892
¶¶

00:02:29.205 --> 00:02:32.039
This is where
it should be.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.234
I want to... go home.

00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:27.324
Mewtwo: This place...

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.160
I cannot stay here.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.507
voice: Go home...

00:03:47.544 --> 00:03:50.244
I want to go home...

00:03:50.246 --> 00:03:51.845
Mewtwo: This voice...

00:04:21.942 --> 00:04:23.541
I can't save
that one !

00:04:47.232 --> 00:04:48.464
Calm yourselves!

00:04:54.871 --> 00:04:57.604
You're the one who asked
for help, are you not?

00:05:01.109 --> 00:05:03.209
I want... to go home.

00:05:28.336 --> 00:05:30.369
The Pokémon restored
from fossils...

00:05:30.371 --> 00:05:31.570
Genesect!

00:05:39.913 --> 00:05:43.247
Created, like me,
at the hands of people.

00:05:58.497 --> 00:06:01.698
(alarm blaring)

00:06:21.419 --> 00:06:23.085
They think everyone
is their enemy.

00:06:24.354 --> 00:06:26.387
Tell me, why have
you come here?

00:06:26.389 --> 00:06:29.690
Here? This was my home.

00:06:29.692 --> 00:06:32.125
Home?

00:06:37.632 --> 00:06:39.164
I want to go home.

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.537
It's all right.

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:48.372
You're safe here!

00:06:48.374 --> 00:06:50.339
Leave them alone!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.477
Stop that!

00:06:58.581 --> 00:07:00.247
Who are you?

00:07:00.249 --> 00:07:02.449
I am Mewtwo.

00:07:02.451 --> 00:07:05.118
You're trying to return
to your home, correct?

00:07:06.321 --> 00:07:07.987
What happened here?

00:07:07.989 --> 00:07:09.388
The world has
completely changed

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:12.257
since you called
this place home,

00:07:12.259 --> 00:07:15.159
eons and eons ago.

00:07:15.161 --> 00:07:17.694
Now... come with me!

00:07:17.696 --> 00:07:19.729
Stay away!

00:07:19.731 --> 00:07:21.731
I need you to
listen to me!

00:07:21.733 --> 00:07:24.433
Don't give us orders!

00:07:34.611 --> 00:07:36.510
Let's go!

00:07:53.128 --> 00:07:58.096
I have all of you
by my side, but...

00:07:58.098 --> 00:07:59.630
The Genesect...

00:08:29.094 --> 00:08:32.361
I'm going... home!

00:08:41.205 --> 00:08:46.107
¶¶

00:09:03.592 --> 00:09:06.593
narrator: The incredible
world of Pokémon!

00:09:06.595 --> 00:09:09.228
A world filled with
mystery and wonder,

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.831
teeming with creatures who never
cease to amaze and delight!

00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:16.868
Pokémon who soar through
the air, swim the world's
oceans,

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.603
and populate
the entire planet,

00:09:18.605 --> 00:09:23.541
expressing life in all
of its abundance!

00:09:23.543 --> 00:09:27.444
Which brings us to a young man
from Pallet Town named Ash,

00:09:27.446 --> 00:09:30.580
traveling the length and breadth
of the world with his friends,

00:09:30.582 --> 00:09:34.617
pursuing his goal of
becoming a Pokémon Master!

00:09:44.729 --> 00:09:46.795
Pikachu?

00:09:46.797 --> 00:09:48.196
Ew?

00:09:48.198 --> 00:09:49.630
Axew!

00:09:49.632 --> 00:09:50.897
Pika, Pika!

00:09:50.899 --> 00:09:53.666
- Pika!
- Axew!

00:09:53.668 --> 00:09:57.269
- Pika, Pika!
- Axew, Ew, Axew!

00:09:59.606 --> 00:10:00.905
Ash: Ah...

00:10:02.275 --> 00:10:03.741
I feel awesome!

00:10:03.743 --> 00:10:05.542
Me too!

00:10:05.544 --> 00:10:08.578
I'm so happy,
I could fly!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.746
The gentle warmth of
the sun filtering through

00:10:10.748 --> 00:10:13.482
the soft scent of
the towering trees...

00:10:13.484 --> 00:10:15.417
A sweet breeze.

00:10:15.419 --> 00:10:19.820
Truly the recipe
for Relaxation Time!

00:10:23.525 --> 00:10:26.559
I can hardly believe we're
in the middle of a city.

00:10:26.561 --> 00:10:28.260
- Ew, Ew!
- Yeah, but we are!

00:10:28.262 --> 00:10:29.628
- Axew, Ew!
- Pika?

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.562
Axew!

00:10:34.233 --> 00:10:35.432
Hey, that's it!

00:10:45.644 --> 00:10:47.577
Welcome to
Pokémon Hills.

00:10:47.579 --> 00:10:48.945
My name's Eric.

00:10:48.947 --> 00:10:51.347
I've been waiting for
you since Professor Oak

00:10:51.349 --> 00:10:52.815
said you were coming.

00:10:52.817 --> 00:10:55.884
Well, let me
show you around!

00:10:55.886 --> 00:10:57.285
My name's Ash.

00:10:57.287 --> 00:10:58.853
And this is my
partner, Pikachu!

00:10:58.855 --> 00:11:00.454
Pikachu!

00:11:00.456 --> 00:11:03.223
And I'm Iris, and this
is my partner, Axew!

00:11:03.225 --> 00:11:04.557
Axew!

00:11:04.559 --> 00:11:06.792
I'm Cilan, a Pokémon
Connoisseur.

00:11:06.794 --> 00:11:10.395
Pleasure...
I can't believe it!

00:11:10.397 --> 00:11:12.764
Being able to see all of this
before it opens to the public.

00:11:12.766 --> 00:11:13.965
The chance of a lifetime!

00:11:13.967 --> 00:11:15.533
- Pika!
- What?

00:11:15.535 --> 00:11:16.901
I don't see any
Chansey anywhere!

00:11:16.903 --> 00:11:19.370
Chance. Not Chansey.

00:11:19.372 --> 00:11:20.738
Ash: Look!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.306
Chansey,
Chansey, Chansey!

00:11:22.308 --> 00:11:23.874
Chansey!

00:11:23.876 --> 00:11:26.643
- Chansey!
- Pika!

00:11:26.645 --> 00:11:28.845
You see, Pokémon
Hills has a number

00:11:28.847 --> 00:11:31.781
of different environments, and
these environments are suitable

00:11:31.783 --> 00:11:34.817
for the many kinds of Pokémon
who are living here!

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:36.585
Pika!

00:11:36.587 --> 00:11:37.786
Cilan: Fantastic!

00:11:37.788 --> 00:11:39.220
- Pidove, Dove!
- Rain!

00:11:39.222 --> 00:11:40.654
- Dove, Pidove!
- Rain, Masquerain!

00:11:40.656 --> 00:11:41.921
- Toad!
- Surskit, Surskit...

00:11:41.923 --> 00:11:43.322
- Surskit!
- Wooper!

00:11:43.324 --> 00:11:44.790
- Lotoad!
- Surskit!

00:11:44.792 --> 00:11:47.659
Iris: They're all having
so much fun!

00:11:47.661 --> 00:11:49.394
Would it be okay if
our Pokémon came out

00:11:49.396 --> 00:11:51.763
- and played here too?
- Of course!

00:11:51.765 --> 00:11:53.331
All right!

00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:54.765
Everybody,
come on out!

00:11:54.767 --> 00:11:57.734
- All of you, too!
- Playtime!

00:11:59.003 --> 00:12:01.269
- Osha!
- Snivy!

00:12:01.271 --> 00:12:02.503
Leavanny!

00:12:02.505 --> 00:12:04.004
- Osha!
- Vy...

00:12:04.006 --> 00:12:06.006
Pig, Pig!

00:12:06.008 --> 00:12:08.908
Char!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.609
Dragonite!

00:12:10.611 --> 00:12:12.243
Emolga!

00:12:12.245 --> 00:12:13.844
Cadrill!

00:12:13.846 --> 00:12:15.812
Pan!

00:12:15.814 --> 00:12:17.847
Crust!

00:12:17.849 --> 00:12:19.448
Stun, Stunfisk!

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:22.350
Pikachu, everyone,
let's go!

