¶ Pokémon ¶¶

00:14:35.199 --> 00:14:37.065
- Beautifly!
- Beau, Beau!

00:14:42.605 --> 00:14:44.905
Eric: The areas surrounding
Pokémon Hills

00:14:44.907 --> 00:14:47.073
have plants from all
around the world,

00:14:47.075 --> 00:14:50.176
so there's always something
in bloom, year round!

00:14:50.178 --> 00:14:51.710
- Amazing!
- Axew, Ew!

00:14:51.712 --> 00:14:53.611
There's nothing more
relaxing than being

00:14:53.613 --> 00:14:56.080
surrounded by the sweet
fragrance of flowers.

00:14:56.082 --> 00:14:57.748
And look up ahead.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.982
A hedge maze.

00:14:58.984 --> 00:15:00.183
Hedge maze?

00:15:00.185 --> 00:15:01.817
How cool is that?

00:15:01.819 --> 00:15:03.718
- See you there!
- Pika, Pika!

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.519
Sableye!

00:15:10.892 --> 00:15:12.191
There, this way,
Pikachu!

00:15:12.193 --> 00:15:13.692
Pikachu!

00:15:13.694 --> 00:15:15.226
Sableye, Sableye,
Sableye!

00:15:15.228 --> 00:15:16.794
Honestly!

00:15:16.796 --> 00:15:18.162
Such a kid.

00:15:18.164 --> 00:15:20.864
Axew.

00:15:22.868 --> 00:15:25.034
Eric, what is it?

00:15:25.036 --> 00:15:27.569
For a second, I thought
I saw something fly by.

00:15:27.571 --> 00:15:30.838
- Ew?
- I guess not.

00:15:32.208 --> 00:15:34.074
Well, I still have
some work to do.

00:15:34.076 --> 00:15:35.742
See you later!

00:15:35.744 --> 00:15:38.043
- both: Thanks for everything,
Eric!
- Axew!

00:15:41.048 --> 00:15:43.715
- This way!
- Pika!

00:15:43.717 --> 00:15:46.851
Sableye!

00:15:53.292 --> 00:15:56.625
Pika!

00:15:59.196 --> 00:16:01.095
What kind of flowers
are those?

00:16:01.097 --> 00:16:03.097
Pikachu!

00:16:04.233 --> 00:16:06.099
Pika?

00:16:10.305 --> 00:16:11.737
Pika!

00:16:11.739 --> 00:16:13.672
Pi, Pi, Pi, Pi...

00:16:18.545 --> 00:16:20.811
Pika, Pika!

00:16:20.813 --> 00:16:23.013
- What is it?
- Pika, Pika!

00:16:23.015 --> 00:16:25.815
- A Pokémon?
- Pika, Pikachu!

00:16:25.817 --> 00:16:28.317
- Is it okay?
- Pika, Pika!

00:16:28.319 --> 00:16:29.885
Wait, are you sure?

00:16:29.887 --> 00:16:31.086
Pi, Pika, Pi!

00:16:31.088 --> 00:16:32.720
Pika!

00:16:32.722 --> 00:16:36.123
Pika!

00:16:41.964 --> 00:16:43.163
Pika!

00:16:43.165 --> 00:16:44.764
Wow, look at it go!

00:16:44.766 --> 00:16:47.633
It really is a Pokémon!

00:16:51.672 --> 00:16:53.604
- Pikachu!
- Pika!

00:16:56.308 --> 00:17:00.243
- This is so cool!
- Pika, Pika!

00:17:00.245 --> 00:17:03.579
Pika!

00:17:03.581 --> 00:17:04.980
Pika!

00:17:04.982 --> 00:17:08.182
- Isn't this fun, buddy?
- Pika, Pika!

00:17:11.587 --> 00:17:13.920
Sableye!

00:17:13.922 --> 00:17:15.922
All right!

00:17:15.924 --> 00:17:20.058
- Yahoo!
- Pika!

00:17:21.127 --> 00:17:22.593
Wow!

00:17:22.595 --> 00:17:24.861
- Whoa!
- Pika!

00:17:24.863 --> 00:17:26.996
Pika!

00:17:27.898 --> 00:17:29.097
Basculin!

00:17:29.099 --> 00:17:30.298
Pika!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.066
- Pika!
- Basc!

00:17:32.068 --> 00:17:33.901
Wow!

00:17:33.903 --> 00:17:35.869
Whoa!

00:17:39.908 --> 00:17:41.107
Pika!

00:17:41.109 --> 00:17:42.308
Pika!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.709
Pikachu!

00:17:43.711 --> 00:17:44.910
Pikachu!

00:17:44.912 --> 00:17:47.646
Pikachu, Pikachu!

00:17:47.648 --> 00:17:49.948
- Pika?
- Thank you!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.649
- Pika, Pika!
- That s cool!

00:17:51.651 --> 00:17:53.083
You can change
your shape, huh?

00:17:53.085 --> 00:17:56.151
- Awesome, I love it!
- Pika!

00:17:58.622 --> 00:18:00.355
Ash: So you're here
all by yourself?

00:18:00.357 --> 00:18:03.658
Pika, Pikachu?

00:18:04.894 --> 00:18:07.194
- I want to go home...
- Pika?

00:18:07.196 --> 00:18:09.396
- You talked!
- Pikachu!

00:18:09.398 --> 00:18:12.332
Home... home...

00:18:12.334 --> 00:18:14.334
So are you lost
or something?

00:18:15.637 --> 00:18:17.103
Lost?

00:18:17.105 --> 00:18:18.370
Don't know
where you are.

00:18:18.372 --> 00:18:20.838
I mean, lost!

00:18:23.309 --> 00:18:25.208
How can
I explain this?

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:28.044
When you're lost, it's
like,  Mommy, Mommy!

00:18:28.046 --> 00:18:30.379
Where are you?

00:18:30.381 --> 00:18:32.681
You get it?

00:18:36.653 --> 00:18:39.120
- Pika...
- Ash!

00:18:44.093 --> 00:18:46.326
- Is that a Pokémon?
- Ew?

00:18:46.328 --> 00:18:47.894
I've never seen it!

00:18:47.896 --> 00:18:49.729
Yeah, I think
it's lost.

00:18:49.731 --> 00:18:51.297
But how do you know?

00:18:51.299 --> 00:18:55.267
- It told me so.
- Yeah?

00:18:55.269 --> 00:18:56.835
- It changed!
- Ew!

00:18:56.837 --> 00:18:58.269
Hey, it's all right.

00:18:58.271 --> 00:19:01.037
- They're friends of mine.
- Pikachu!

00:19:03.207 --> 00:19:06.708
- Wow, awesome!
- Axew!

00:19:08.211 --> 00:19:11.011
Axew!

00:19:14.282 --> 00:19:16.282
Ew?

00:19:16.284 --> 00:19:18.717
Pika...

00:19:20.921 --> 00:19:25.023
I want to go home...

00:19:25.025 --> 00:19:26.224
What's the matter?

00:19:26.226 --> 00:19:28.893
- Whoa, are you crying?
- Pikachu?

00:19:28.895 --> 00:19:30.361
Go home...

00:19:30.363 --> 00:19:33.197
- Go home...
- Come on, don't cry.

00:19:33.199 --> 00:19:34.398
Pika!

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.433
You've got nothing
to worry about!

00:19:36.435 --> 00:19:38.134
Tell you what,
we'll help you

00:19:38.136 --> 00:19:41.403
- get back home, I promise.
- Pika, Pikachu!

00:19:41.405 --> 00:19:43.872
- You will?
- Hold on a sec, Ash.

00:19:43.874 --> 00:19:45.807
Do you actually know
where its home is?

00:19:45.809 --> 00:19:47.341
Nope!

00:19:47.343 --> 00:19:49.409
That could be
a problem!

00:19:49.411 --> 00:19:51.244
Everything'll
work out.

00:19:51.246 --> 00:19:53.846
- I'll make it work out!
- Pikachu!

00:19:53.848 --> 00:19:56.381
Uh... don't make a promise
you can't keep.

00:19:56.383 --> 00:19:58.282
If you came across
a lost kid, you wouldn't

00:19:58.284 --> 00:20:01.151
- just walk away, would you?
- Pika, Pika!

00:20:01.153 --> 00:20:03.953
No, I guess I wouldn't.

00:20:03.955 --> 00:20:06.221
Pika?

00:20:09.893 --> 00:20:12.059
That's awesome, all
your friends are here.

00:20:12.061 --> 00:20:14.327
You'll be fine!

00:20:18.399 --> 00:20:19.898
Pika!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.366
What's the big
idea attacking us?

00:20:21.368 --> 00:20:23.301
Pika!

00:20:23.303 --> 00:20:25.269
Pikachu,
use Thunderbolt!

00:20:25.271 --> 00:20:29.239
Pi, Pikachu!

00:20:29.241 --> 00:20:32.809
- Come on, Ash, this way!
- Ash, hurry!

00:20:32.811 --> 00:20:36.512
Pika!

00:20:36.514 --> 00:20:39.081
Chu!

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:45.153
Pika!

00:20:46.756 --> 00:20:48.388
Pikachu!

00:20:49.457 --> 00:20:50.856
Ew, Ew!

00:20:50.858 --> 00:20:55.260
- Pikachu...
- Pi... ka...

00:20:57.297 --> 00:20:59.864
Who are they?

00:20:59.866 --> 00:21:02.199
Ew!

00:21:03.302 --> 00:21:05.468
What are you doing?

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:08.504
Destroy the enemy!

00:21:10.341 --> 00:21:12.273
Do it!

00:21:14.577 --> 00:21:16.410
Yes...

00:21:23.618 --> 00:21:25.484
Ew!

00:21:25.486 --> 00:21:27.552
Wait, stop!

00:21:29.522 --> 00:21:31.588
Do it!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.460
- I said stop!
- Pika!

00:21:38.462 --> 00:21:41.595
- Do it!
- Yes, I must...

00:21:43.198 --> 00:21:45.531
Stop it, now!

00:22:00.513 --> 00:22:02.479
Let's go!

00:22:29.574 --> 00:22:31.373
- It just changed!
- Hold on.

00:22:31.375 --> 00:22:32.640
You're...

00:22:32.642 --> 00:22:34.541
I am Mewtwo.

00:22:34.543 --> 00:22:36.342
Cilan: Mewtwo?

00:22:36.344 --> 00:22:37.943
Are you all right?

00:22:37.945 --> 00:22:39.311
- Yeah.
- Axew!

00:22:39.313 --> 00:22:40.545
We're fine!

00:22:40.547 --> 00:22:43.314
I am not speaking
to you.

00:22:43.316 --> 00:22:45.516
I am asking
Pikachu and Axew.

00:22:45.518 --> 00:22:47.618
- Ew?
- Pika, Pikachu!

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:49.519
Axew!

00:22:49.521 --> 00:22:51.387
That was dangerous.

00:22:51.389 --> 00:22:53.489
Pika, Pika!

00:22:53.491 --> 00:22:55.591
Thanks for getting us
out of that trouble!

00:22:55.593 --> 00:22:57.659
I don't need
your gratitude.

00:22:57.661 --> 00:23:01.229
I was only trying to
save the Pokémon.

00:23:01.231 --> 00:23:03.231
Wait a minute!

00:23:03.233 --> 00:23:05.066
Who was that Pokémon
we were with before?

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:10.170
Please tell me,
I've gotta know!

00:23:16.978 --> 00:23:19.478
Genesect, a Pokémon
who's been extinct

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:21.980
for three hundred
million years.

00:23:21.982 --> 00:23:23.448
Wow, Genesect...

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:25.349
An extinct Pokémon.

00:23:25.351 --> 00:23:27.351
But why are
they here?

00:23:27.353 --> 00:23:30.253
The Genesect were restored
from ancient fossils

00:23:30.255 --> 00:23:34.056
and then had weapons attached
to their bodies by people.

00:23:34.058 --> 00:23:36.224
Restored from fossils?

00:23:36.226 --> 00:23:40.061
For them, everything that
exists today is totally new.

00:23:40.063 --> 00:23:41.395
A completely
alien world.

00:23:43.298 --> 00:23:44.764
So when they open their eyes,

00:23:44.766 --> 00:23:47.700
everything around them had been
thoroughly transformed!

00:23:47.702 --> 00:23:49.535
I get it...

00:23:49.537 --> 00:23:55.607
And so, in truth, the Genesect
do not belong in this world.

00:23:58.211 --> 00:23:59.777
The same as me.

00:23:59.779 --> 00:24:01.678
Cilan: You?

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:03.446
Yes.

00:24:03.448 --> 00:24:06.582
I am also a Pokémon who
was created by people!

00:24:07.651 --> 00:24:11.219
I know precisely
how they feel.

00:24:15.792 --> 00:24:19.360
They see everything around
them as their enemies!

00:24:19.362 --> 00:24:21.562
Hold on!

00:24:21.564 --> 00:24:24.565
It didn't act like
that at all...

00:24:29.071 --> 00:24:30.737
- But it attacked us.
- Right.

00:24:30.739 --> 00:24:33.506
- Yeah, but...
- Pika, Pika!

00:24:33.508 --> 00:24:36.675
I want you to forget
that you saw me.

00:24:47.286 --> 00:24:49.552
Mewtwo...

00:24:49.554 --> 00:24:51.287
You saw that,
didn't you?

00:24:51.289 --> 00:24:52.688
With both my eyes!

00:24:52.690 --> 00:24:54.356
And heard it, right?

00:24:54.358 --> 00:24:57.058
I can hear
the grass grow!

00:24:57.060 --> 00:24:58.826
We've hit
the jackpot!

00:24:58.828 --> 00:25:01.228
We've just been given the
opportunity of a lifetime!

00:25:01.230 --> 00:25:02.529
Yeah!

00:25:02.531 --> 00:25:04.531
- Lucky us!
- Life's a game of chance!

00:25:04.533 --> 00:25:06.266
Feeling chancey!

00:25:06.268 --> 00:25:10.202
Chancey, Chancey, Chancey,
Chancey, Chancey, Chancey.

00:25:11.505 --> 00:25:12.770
All those many
long, long hours

00:25:12.772 --> 00:25:15.239
we've put in chasing
after Pikachu.

00:25:15.241 --> 00:25:17.507
It's paying off
for me and you!

00:25:17.509 --> 00:25:21.377
Imagine commanding a group
of Genesect into battle.

00:25:21.379 --> 00:25:24.580
And install Mewtwo as
the head of our crew...

00:25:24.582 --> 00:25:26.615
We'll rule the world!

00:25:26.617 --> 00:25:28.650
With an iron fist!

00:25:28.652 --> 00:25:31.653
And with a queen
no one can resist!

00:25:31.655 --> 00:25:34.288
Let's get those Genesect and
bring our dreams to light!

00:25:34.290 --> 00:25:36.290
Right!

00:25:40.529 --> 00:25:42.295
Pidove, Dove!

00:25:42.297 --> 00:25:49.167
Dove, Pidove!

00:25:50.603 --> 00:25:52.636
Nurse Joy: Genesect and
Mewtwo...

00:25:52.638 --> 00:25:55.238
I've never heard
of those Pokémon.

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:57.173
Me neither.

00:25:57.175 --> 00:25:58.607
You see, we were
suddenly attacked

00:25:58.609 --> 00:26:00.308
by a group of Genesect.

00:26:00.310 --> 00:26:02.843
Then Mewtwo appeared
and rescued us!

00:26:02.845 --> 00:26:05.412
That's right, though
Mewtwo kind

00:26:05.414 --> 00:26:09.115
of gave the three of
us the cold shoulder.

00:26:09.117 --> 00:26:12.751
I'd say Mewtwo doesn't seem
to like people very much.

00:26:14.154 --> 00:26:15.653
Those flowers...

00:26:15.655 --> 00:26:17.821
They're like the ones I saw
blooming at that lake.

00:26:17.823 --> 00:26:19.355
Right!

00:26:19.357 --> 00:26:21.290
I took a lot of
pictures of them.

00:26:21.292 --> 00:26:23.158
Back when we transplanted
them straight

00:26:23.160 --> 00:26:25.660
from Absentia
Natural Park!

00:26:25.662 --> 00:26:27.662
Cilan: It's a type of
lotus, right?

00:26:27.664 --> 00:26:29.897
Panna Lotus is what
they're called.

00:26:29.899 --> 00:26:31.598
It's said to be
the most ancient

00:26:31.600 --> 00:26:34.534
of all flowers in
existence today!

00:26:34.536 --> 00:26:36.736
We were actually able
to successfully transplant

00:26:36.738 --> 00:26:38.704
those flowers
into our park.

00:26:38.706 --> 00:26:41.540
You're quite proud of
that, Eric, aren't you?

00:26:42.676 --> 00:26:44.442
Whoops!

00:26:44.444 --> 00:26:45.643
- Axew!
- Pika!

00:26:45.645 --> 00:26:47.578
Pikachu's feeling
much better now!

00:26:47.580 --> 00:26:48.845
Aud, Audino!

00:26:48.847 --> 00:26:51.681
- Pika, Pi!
- Ew!

00:26:51.683 --> 00:26:53.282
Looking good,
buddy!

00:26:53.284 --> 00:26:56.818
- Pika, Pikachu!
- Ew!

00:26:56.820 --> 00:27:00.922
(sirens wailing)

00:27:11.333 --> 00:27:13.232
Bello, Bell, Bello!

00:27:13.234 --> 00:27:16.501
- Ledy!
- Deerling, Deerling!

00:27:16.503 --> 00:27:19.403
- Saws!
- Herd, Herd, Herd, Herd!

00:27:19.405 --> 00:27:20.771
Durant,
Durant, Durant!

00:27:42.527 --> 00:27:43.893
- Dwebble!
- Geodude, Geodude!

00:27:43.895 --> 00:27:45.895
- Golem!
- Dwebble...

00:27:45.897 --> 00:27:49.198
- Dwebble, Dweb!
- Geodude!

00:27:49.934 --> 00:27:51.333
Surskit, Surskit!

00:27:51.335 --> 00:27:53.668
Surskit, Surskit,
Surskit!

00:27:58.307 --> 00:28:00.440
Gatr!

00:28:02.610 --> 00:28:04.643
- Beau, Beautifly!
- Beautifly, Beautifly!

00:28:04.645 --> 00:28:06.711
- Shroomish!
- Roserade!

00:28:11.817 --> 00:28:13.849
Masquerain, Masquerain!

00:28:17.588 --> 00:28:19.721
Starly, Starly,
Starly, Starly!

00:28:19.723 --> 00:28:22.623
Starly, Starly,
Starly, Starly, Starly!

00:28:54.856 --> 00:28:59.325
Sab, Sable...
Sableye!

00:29:03.798 --> 00:29:07.266
Sab, Sab, Sab, Sab, Sableye,
Sableye, Sableye!

00:29:07.268 --> 00:29:08.767
Sableye, Sableye,
Sableye!

00:29:12.939 --> 00:29:14.405
Watch!

00:29:14.407 --> 00:29:15.706
Watchog!

00:29:15.708 --> 00:29:17.674
Watchog!

00:29:19.844 --> 00:29:21.710
- Durr?
- Looks like power trouble.

00:29:23.447 --> 00:29:26.948
- Eevee!
- Neva, Tanner, hurry!

00:29:26.950 --> 00:29:29.750
- Okay!
- Eevee!

00:29:35.357 --> 00:29:38.624
- That's weird...
- Ee?

00:29:38.626 --> 00:29:39.925
- Eevee...
- Watchog!

00:29:39.927 --> 00:29:41.726
- What's for dinner?
- Watch, Watchog!

00:29:41.728 --> 00:29:43.394
- I wanna have sandwiches!
- Watchog!

00:29:43.396 --> 00:29:45.028
woman: Okay, that
sounds great!

00:29:45.030 --> 00:29:47.663
Soon as we're done, I could
go for some sandwiches myself!

00:29:47.665 --> 00:29:48.864
- Durr!
- Great!

00:29:48.866 --> 00:29:50.065
man: You pick up the tab.

00:29:50.067 --> 00:29:51.533
Gurrdurr!

00:29:51.535 --> 00:29:53.868
man: Not again!

00:29:54.570 --> 00:29:55.769
Hey!

00:29:55.771 --> 00:29:56.970
Thanks a lot, Ampharos!

00:29:56.972 --> 00:30:00.840
So let's... get
this wrapped up!

00:30:00.842 --> 00:30:02.908
Watchog!

00:30:04.778 --> 00:30:06.444
all: Yay, time to eat!

00:30:08.748 --> 00:30:10.080
- Pikachu!
- Wow, this is so good!

00:30:10.082 --> 00:30:11.648
- Yeah!
- Pika!

00:30:11.650 --> 00:30:13.483
- Axew, Ew, Ew!
- It's the local specialty.

00:30:13.485 --> 00:30:14.917
- Axew...
- It's delicious!

00:30:21.659 --> 00:30:23.659
What's going on?

00:30:23.661 --> 00:30:25.560
Woo, Woobat, Woobat!

00:30:25.562 --> 00:30:27.762
- Woobat.
- Swoobat, Swoobat!

00:30:27.764 --> 00:30:29.730
Swoobat!

00:30:31.934 --> 00:30:33.733
What's all
the hubbub?

00:30:33.735 --> 00:30:36.535
They're saying they were
attacked by some wacko Pokémon.

00:30:36.537 --> 00:30:37.969
I'll bet you it's
the Genesect!

00:30:37.971 --> 00:30:39.637
You'd win that bet!

00:30:39.639 --> 00:30:42.806
Ready or not, little
Genesect, here we come!

00:30:46.912 --> 00:30:48.144
- Pika, Pika!
- Axew!

00:30:48.146 --> 00:30:49.979
- Ew, Axew!
- Pika!

00:30:49.981 --> 00:30:51.914
- Ew, Axew, Ew!
- Pika, Pika, Pika!

00:30:51.916 --> 00:30:53.548
- Axew, Ew!
- Pika!

00:30:53.550 --> 00:30:56.050
- Axew, Axew, Axew, Axew!
- Pika?

00:30:56.052 --> 00:30:57.918
Sab, Sableye,
Sableye, Sableye!

00:30:57.920 --> 00:31:00.620
Sableye, Sableye,
Sableye!

00:31:00.622 --> 00:31:03.489
- Sableye, what?
- Pikachu!

00:31:03.491 --> 00:31:07.659
- Sableye!
- Pikachu!

00:31:07.661 --> 00:31:09.627
Eye, Eye, Sableye!

00:31:09.629 --> 00:31:10.861
It's Pokémon Hills.

00:31:10.863 --> 00:31:13.096
Something must
be wrong!

00:31:18.836 --> 00:31:20.101
Sab, Sab, Sab!

00:31:20.103 --> 00:31:22.036
Sableye, Sable,
Sableye.

00:31:22.038 --> 00:31:24.605
Deerling, Deerling,
Deerling!

00:31:24.607 --> 00:31:26.039
Something's up,
that's for sure!

00:31:26.041 --> 00:31:28.107
- Sableye!
- Deer?

00:31:30.744 --> 00:31:32.643
Feraligatr!

00:31:33.746 --> 00:31:34.945
Fer!

00:31:34.947 --> 00:31:37.113
Eric: Feraligatr!

00:31:40.885 --> 00:31:42.084
It's Genesect...

00:31:42.086 --> 00:31:43.985
So that's what
they look like...

00:31:43.987 --> 00:31:45.886
Why are they chasing
away the Pokémon?

00:31:45.888 --> 00:31:48.088
Axew!

00:31:49.191 --> 00:31:50.590
Roserade.

00:31:50.592 --> 00:31:52.024
Roserade.

00:31:52.026 --> 00:31:53.892
This Ralts has been
badly hurt!

00:31:53.894 --> 00:31:55.960
I'll run to
the Pokémon Center!

00:31:55.962 --> 00:31:57.962
Thank you!

00:32:03.568 --> 00:32:05.668
Eye!

00:32:09.607 --> 00:32:11.106
- What are you doing?
- Pika!

00:32:11.108 --> 00:32:12.974
We should turn back!

00:32:12.976 --> 00:32:14.175
But why?

00:32:14.177 --> 00:32:15.976
There's no need
to upset them here.

00:32:15.978 --> 00:32:19.612
Ash!

00:32:24.117 --> 00:32:25.516
This way!

00:32:25.518 --> 00:32:27.718
Sable, Sableye,
Sable, Sable!

00:32:35.026 --> 00:32:37.059
Eric: The workers use
this corridor.

00:32:37.061 --> 00:32:39.227
It connects to
Pokémon Hills.

00:32:56.946 --> 00:32:58.545
Meowth: What's up with that?

00:32:58.547 --> 00:32:59.746
Who cares?

00:32:59.748 --> 00:33:01.047
Let's catch
them all pronto!

00:33:01.049 --> 00:33:03.049
Off we go!

00:33:19.834 --> 00:33:21.567
What's this?

00:33:21.569 --> 00:33:22.768
Power.

00:33:22.770 --> 00:33:25.036
It's the transformer
substation.

00:33:25.038 --> 00:33:27.171
It sends electricity
to the whole city.

00:33:27.873 --> 00:33:29.105
Look...

00:33:29.107 --> 00:33:31.307
Sable!

00:33:35.779 --> 00:33:38.179
(sirens wailing)

00:34:50.085 --> 00:34:53.052
Mewtwo: I always thought
I was alone...

00:34:53.054 --> 00:34:55.721
I rejected everything.

00:35:17.110 --> 00:35:19.143
- Ccino!
- Nido!

00:35:19.145 --> 00:35:21.245
- Oddish!
- Furret, Furret?

00:35:21.247 --> 00:35:23.280
- Tang, Tang?
- Tangrowth?

00:35:27.886 --> 00:35:30.019
Ccino,
Ccino, Ccino...

00:35:30.021 --> 00:35:33.055
- Whim!
- Lil!

00:35:33.057 --> 00:35:34.322
Whim!

00:35:45.401 --> 00:35:47.367
Mewtwo: But...

00:35:47.369 --> 00:35:50.103
I wasn't alone
after all.

00:35:55.243 --> 00:35:56.842
- Swanna!
- Swanna!

00:35:56.844 --> 00:36:00.178
Swanna!

00:36:00.180 --> 00:36:01.712
- Vul, Vulpix?
- Tangrowth.

00:36:01.714 --> 00:36:03.847
- Ccino, Ccino.
- Teddiursa!

00:36:09.187 --> 00:36:12.922
Finally, I had discovered
a place where I belong.

00:36:17.428 --> 00:36:19.461
The Genesect
deserve as much!

00:36:19.463 --> 00:36:20.862
Starly, Star,
Star, Star!

00:36:20.864 --> 00:36:22.163
Starly,
Starly, Starly!

00:36:22.165 --> 00:36:23.864
Starly, Starly,
Starly!

00:36:23.866 --> 00:36:26.032
What?

00:36:26.034 --> 00:36:28.300
I understand.

00:36:35.408 --> 00:36:37.808
Starly, Starly,
Starly, Starly, Starly!

00:37:00.231 --> 00:37:01.830
Where did that
thing come from?

00:37:01.832 --> 00:37:03.431
- Whoa, it's huge!
- Pika!

00:37:07.470 --> 00:37:08.969
Sable!

00:37:08.971 --> 00:37:11.538
Sableye!
Sableye, Sableye!

00:37:15.977 --> 00:37:17.176
Pikachu?

00:37:17.178 --> 00:37:19.278
Pikachu!

00:37:19.280 --> 00:37:21.113
- Hey, it's you!
- Pika!

00:37:23.150 --> 00:37:26.184
Please... forgive me.

00:37:26.186 --> 00:37:27.385
It's apologizing...

00:37:27.387 --> 00:37:29.286
- Yeah, but why?
- Axew!

00:37:29.288 --> 00:37:30.987
I know.

00:37:30.989 --> 00:37:34.323
It can't disobey
the red Genesect!

00:37:36.527 --> 00:37:39.127
Over here, this way!

00:37:45.034 --> 00:37:49.336
I guess you must really
like this flower, huh?

00:37:49.338 --> 00:37:51.871
I like this flower.

00:37:51.873 --> 00:37:53.572
- There.
- Pika?

00:37:53.574 --> 00:37:56.341
It bloomed in our home...

00:37:56.343 --> 00:37:59.109
In your home?

00:38:01.113 --> 00:38:02.345
I get it!

00:38:02.347 --> 00:38:04.113
This has to be
the Genesect s nest!

00:38:04.115 --> 00:38:05.981
Ew, Ew!

00:38:05.983 --> 00:38:07.349
Of course!

00:38:07.351 --> 00:38:09.217
They thought it would
be perfect in here!

00:38:09.219 --> 00:38:11.185
Pika!

00:38:23.298 --> 00:38:24.497
Eye?

00:38:24.499 --> 00:38:26.232
Sableye!

00:38:38.078 --> 00:38:40.845
- This is bad!
- What's wrong?

00:38:42.281 --> 00:38:43.513
It's out of control.

00:38:43.515 --> 00:38:45.581
If we don t
fix this...

00:38:56.226 --> 00:38:58.893
We've got to stop
the Genesect!

00:38:58.895 --> 00:39:00.961
And not just for
Pokémon Hills.

00:39:00.963 --> 00:39:02.495
The entire city
is in danger!

00:39:02.497 --> 00:39:04.296
We've gotta
do something!

00:39:04.298 --> 00:39:06.898
- Yeah, but what?
- Pika, Pika!

00:39:11.271 --> 00:39:13.404
Gatr...

00:39:20.980 --> 00:39:22.179
Feraligatr!

00:39:23.215 --> 00:39:25.215
No way!

00:39:25.217 --> 00:39:27.550
Gatr!

00:39:28.319 --> 00:39:31.219
Gatr!

00:39:31.221 --> 00:39:33.321
Ral?

00:39:33.323 --> 00:39:35.523
Feraligatr!

00:39:40.262 --> 00:39:41.594
- Mewtwo!
- Pika?

00:39:41.596 --> 00:39:43.596
- Incredible!
- Sab!

00:39:44.899 --> 00:39:47.365
Tr, Gatr!

00:39:50.570 --> 00:39:52.636
Oh, no!

00:39:52.638 --> 00:39:54.337
I'm off to
the substation!

00:39:54.339 --> 00:39:56.639
All of you, get
out of here!

00:40:00.378 --> 00:40:03.379
You mustn't hurt the other
Pokémon in the city!

00:40:04.949 --> 00:40:07.416
I want you to
come with me!

00:40:07.418 --> 00:40:09.684
Don't give me orders!

00:40:11.487 --> 00:40:13.320
Pika!

00:40:15.123 --> 00:40:16.322
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

00:40:16.324 --> 00:40:19.124
Chu, Pika!

00:40:21.294 --> 00:40:23.460
Pika.

00:40:23.462 --> 00:40:24.661
Pika?

00:40:24.663 --> 00:40:26.062
Pi... Pi, Pi!

00:40:26.064 --> 00:40:29.231
Pika, Pika,
Pika, Pika!

00:40:33.171 --> 00:40:37.139
- Pikachu!
- Axew!

00:40:48.485 --> 00:40:50.718
You must
listen to me!

00:40:56.191 --> 00:40:57.523
All right.

00:40:57.525 --> 00:40:59.491
If you refuse to
listen to reason,

00:40:59.493 --> 00:41:02.527
I'll have no other choice
but to battle you.

00:41:11.738 --> 00:41:14.171
Eevee?

00:41:20.345 --> 00:41:22.444
Vee...

00:41:25.816 --> 00:41:27.215
Stop it!

00:41:27.217 --> 00:41:29.116
People live
in there!

00:41:29.118 --> 00:41:32.586
Interfere and you
will be destroyed!

00:41:42.497 --> 00:41:45.631
I guess I'm simply
wasting my breath.

00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:08.286
What?

00:42:46.725 --> 00:42:48.624
Quick, Pikachu,
Electro Ball!

00:42:48.626 --> 00:42:51.726
Pika, Pika, Pika,
Pikachu, Pi!

00:42:54.564 --> 00:42:56.430
Pikachu!

00:43:00.536 --> 00:43:02.269
Pikachu!

00:43:06.707 --> 00:43:09.474
- Eye!
- Pika?

00:43:10.710 --> 00:43:12.776
Pika!

00:43:16.648 --> 00:43:18.781
(alarm beeping)

00:43:25.689 --> 00:43:26.888
- Sable...
- Pika!

00:43:32.462 --> 00:43:34.428
Sab, Sab,
Sab, Sableye!

00:43:39.768 --> 00:43:42.268
Crustle!

00:43:47.241 --> 00:43:48.807
We came as fast
as we could!

00:43:48.809 --> 00:43:50.375
Golem!

00:43:50.377 --> 00:43:52.844
- Cilan!
- Pika!

00:43:55.748 --> 00:43:57.614
- Saws, Saws!
- Breloom!

00:43:57.616 --> 00:44:02.785
- Loom, Loom!
- Golem!

00:44:02.787 --> 00:44:05.287
Gatr!

00:44:10.259 --> 00:44:12.325
Genesect: Enemy!

00:44:15.363 --> 00:44:18.697
Destroy them!

00:44:18.699 --> 00:44:20.865
We must destroy...

00:44:29.808 --> 00:44:32.275
Ash: Stop it!

00:44:33.444 --> 00:44:34.776
You don't understand!

00:44:34.778 --> 00:44:36.944
All the Genesect want is
to have their own home!

00:44:36.946 --> 00:44:38.712
Pika, Pikachu!

00:44:38.714 --> 00:44:40.447
So what does
that mean?

00:44:40.449 --> 00:44:42.482
Look!

00:44:49.323 --> 00:44:51.423
- Enemy.
- Destroy them.

00:44:51.425 --> 00:44:52.791
Destroy them!

00:44:52.793 --> 00:44:55.660
Pika?

00:44:56.396 --> 00:44:58.329
Pika!

00:45:20.419 --> 00:45:21.618
Are you okay?

00:45:21.620 --> 00:45:23.753
Pikachu!

00:45:25.757 --> 00:45:27.756
Feral!

00:45:30.026 --> 00:45:31.692
Gatr!

00:45:31.694 --> 00:45:33.527
Breloom, Breloom!

00:45:37.900 --> 00:45:39.799
Golem!

00:45:39.801 --> 00:45:42.835
Ew!

00:45:42.837 --> 00:45:44.969
Persian!

00:45:48.541 --> 00:45:50.707
Persian!

00:45:52.410 --> 00:45:54.443
- Geodude!
- Geodude, Dude!

00:45:54.445 --> 00:45:55.877
Golem!

00:45:55.879 --> 00:45:57.745
Lem!

00:46:02.884 --> 00:46:05.618
- Feral!
- Brel, Brel, Breloom!

00:46:05.620 --> 00:46:07.853
Feraligatr!

00:46:09.022 --> 00:46:10.988
Sableye!

00:46:12.424 --> 00:46:13.890
Ferali...

00:46:13.892 --> 00:46:16.025
Persian...

00:46:23.400 --> 00:46:25.632
Sawsbuck!

00:46:28.069 --> 00:46:30.769
Sawsbuck!

00:46:30.771 --> 00:46:33.772
Get in formation.

00:46:33.774 --> 00:46:35.373
Destroy them!

00:46:35.375 --> 00:46:37.408
Pika!

00:46:38.377 --> 00:46:39.576
Saws!

00:46:39.578 --> 00:46:40.877
Gatr!

00:46:40.879 --> 00:46:43.779
Pika!

00:46:43.781 --> 00:46:45.814
Sawsbuck,
Sawsbuck...

00:46:45.816 --> 00:46:49.050
- Saw!
- Persian!

00:46:53.489 --> 00:46:54.688
No...

00:46:54.690 --> 00:46:56.690
Don't do it!

00:46:56.692 --> 00:46:59.492
Please stop
it now!

00:47:06.867 --> 00:47:08.366
Sab, Sableye!

00:47:08.368 --> 00:47:09.633
- Bellossom!
- Deerling!

00:47:09.635 --> 00:47:11.635
- Saws!
- Sableye!

00:47:11.637 --> 00:47:12.902
Pika, Pi!

00:47:12.904 --> 00:47:15.403
Pika!

00:47:18.608 --> 00:47:20.040
- Pika!
- Genesect!

00:47:20.042 --> 00:47:22.374
You were trying
to protect me!

00:47:25.545 --> 00:47:28.711
I'm glad you're
all right...

00:47:31.449 --> 00:47:32.648
Oh, no.

00:47:32.650 --> 00:47:35.450
- Genesect, wake up!
- Pika!

00:47:38.788 --> 00:47:40.821
Pikachu?

00:47:40.823 --> 00:47:43.423
- Golem!
- Breloom!

00:47:50.664 --> 00:47:53.731
Grav, Grav, Graveler!

00:47:53.733 --> 00:47:56.133
- Saws, Saws?
- Deerling, Deerling!

00:47:59.037 --> 00:48:00.836
Pika!

00:48:23.827 --> 00:48:25.092
- Grav, Gravel!
- Sawsbuck!

00:48:25.094 --> 00:48:27.561
Golem!

00:48:34.002 --> 00:48:36.769
- It's Mewtwo!
- Pikachu!

00:48:47.648 --> 00:48:49.047
The Genesect.

00:48:49.049 --> 00:48:53.518
Understand they don't
belong in this world.

00:48:57.991 --> 00:49:01.726
The very same as it
once was for me.

00:49:06.099 --> 00:49:08.766
I can't allow
this anymore.

00:49:08.768 --> 00:49:12.736
If you do not stop now,
I will defeat you.

00:49:15.607 --> 00:49:18.007
You cannot defeat us!

00:50:14.865 --> 00:50:16.998
- It's so fast!
- Ew!

00:50:22.705 --> 00:50:23.904
Pika?

00:50:23.906 --> 00:50:25.138
- Sableye?
- Are you all right?

00:50:25.140 --> 00:50:28.207
Pika?
The flowers...

00:50:35.916 --> 00:50:38.248
- Sawsbuck.
- Feraligatr!

00:50:40.986 --> 00:50:42.819
Sableye!

00:50:50.295 --> 00:50:51.961
Home.

00:50:51.963 --> 00:50:55.998
I want to go home.

00:50:56.000 --> 00:50:57.232
- Ew.
- Pika...

00:50:57.234 --> 00:50:59.601
Eye...

00:50:59.603 --> 00:51:01.202
- Herd.
- Gatr.

00:51:01.204 --> 00:51:03.571
- Bello...
- Deerling, Deerling.

00:51:03.573 --> 00:51:05.673
Kirlia...

00:51:31.099 --> 00:51:32.965
Now!

00:51:58.124 --> 00:52:00.190
Now what?

00:52:01.293 --> 00:52:03.893
- Pika?
- Ew!

00:52:03.895 --> 00:52:05.361
I don't see an exit!

00:52:06.063 --> 00:52:08.196
Oy.

00:52:14.237 --> 00:52:16.837
Durant, Durant!

00:52:16.839 --> 00:52:18.238
all: We're sorry!

00:52:18.240 --> 00:52:20.240
Durant!

00:52:21.843 --> 00:52:25.811
all: We're blasting
off again!

00:52:28.282 --> 00:52:30.415
Nurse Joy: No light?

00:52:30.417 --> 00:52:33.418
I'm going to go check
on the other Pokémon.

00:52:49.001 --> 00:52:51.101
- Crust?
- Golem!

00:52:51.103 --> 00:52:52.869
Crustle?

00:53:01.779 --> 00:53:04.079
- Ew!
- Pika!

00:53:04.081 --> 00:53:06.181
Oshawott, I choose you!

00:53:07.350 --> 00:53:08.949
Osha!

00:53:08.951 --> 00:53:11.017
Quick, use Hydro Pump
and put out that fire!

00:53:11.019 --> 00:53:12.218
Oshawott!

00:53:12.220 --> 00:53:14.386
Wott!

00:53:18.091 --> 00:53:20.824
Osha, Osha,
Oshawott!

00:53:22.227 --> 00:53:23.459
Gatr!

00:53:23.461 --> 00:53:26.261
Feral!

00:53:28.231 --> 00:53:30.564
Oshawott!

00:53:30.566 --> 00:53:31.965
Golem, Golem!

00:53:31.967 --> 00:53:37.570
Deerling, Deerling,
Deerling!

00:53:37.572 --> 00:53:40.338
- Geo, Geodude.
- Golem!

00:53:43.042 --> 00:53:45.242
Deerling,
Deerling, Deerling!

00:53:47.145 --> 00:53:51.480
Sableye!

00:53:55.252 --> 00:53:57.385
Everyone...

00:54:03.526 --> 00:54:05.993
Feral!

00:54:11.500 --> 00:54:12.899
Deerling, Deer!

00:54:12.901 --> 00:54:15.067
Deer!

00:54:31.285 --> 00:54:34.019
Persian!

00:54:38.525 --> 00:54:41.292
Feral!

00:54:41.294 --> 00:54:43.394
- Gatr, Tr!
- Persian!

00:54:43.396 --> 00:54:46.397
- Ew, Axew!
- Pikachu!

00:54:54.639 --> 00:54:56.604
- Ew!
- Pika!

00:54:59.442 --> 00:55:01.375
- Ew!
- Genesect!

00:55:03.345 --> 00:55:05.377
Pika!

00:55:07.481 --> 00:55:09.380
Pi?

00:55:11.283 --> 00:55:14.083
- It was you three...
- Pika, Pika!

00:55:18.622 --> 00:55:21.589
- Hang in there, please!
- Pikachu!

00:55:38.407 --> 00:55:41.141
Mewtwo!

00:56:05.667 --> 00:56:08.467
- Wait, stop!
- Pikachu!

00:56:12.706 --> 00:56:16.174
The thing is, this place
isn't your home.

00:56:16.176 --> 00:56:18.543
But there's gotta be
a home for you somewhere,

00:56:18.545 --> 00:56:22.113
I'm sure of it!

00:56:22.115 --> 00:56:23.414
- Ash, run!
- Hurry up!

00:56:23.416 --> 00:56:25.015
Move away from there!

00:56:25.017 --> 00:56:27.083
I will not!

00:56:32.289 --> 00:56:33.488
Tell you what.

00:56:33.490 --> 00:56:35.623
We'll help you get back
home, I promise.

00:56:35.625 --> 00:56:38.225
Pika, Pikachu!

00:56:38.227 --> 00:56:42.195
You see...
I gave my word.

00:56:42.197 --> 00:56:46.098
I promised I'd take
it back home!

00:56:48.135 --> 00:56:49.634
Mewtwo.

00:56:49.636 --> 00:56:51.702
All Pokémon
belong somewhere.

00:56:51.704 --> 00:56:55.105
There's a place
for every Pokémon!

00:56:56.675 --> 00:56:59.642
Both of you,
stop fighting now!
Pika! Pika!

00:56:59.644 --> 00:57:03.044
Don't give me orders!

00:57:05.548 --> 00:57:08.981
- Stop...
- Pikachu!

00:57:12.453 --> 00:57:13.652
Stop!

00:57:13.654 --> 00:57:15.620
Enough!

00:57:16.556 --> 00:57:18.188
How can you?

00:57:18.190 --> 00:57:20.290
Pika, Pika...
Pikachu!

00:57:20.292 --> 00:57:22.258
- Breloom!
- Sawsbuck, Sawsbuck!

00:57:22.260 --> 00:57:23.759
- Golem!
- Graveler!

00:57:23.761 --> 00:57:26.294
- Breloom, Breloom!
- Bello, Bello, Bellossom!

00:57:29.232 --> 00:57:31.398
All of you.

00:57:33.101 --> 00:57:34.633
All of you...

00:57:34.635 --> 00:57:37.369
Enemies!

00:57:51.017 --> 00:57:54.518
You stubbornly refuse
to understand!

00:57:59.291 --> 00:58:00.490
Mewtwo!

00:58:09.534 --> 00:58:12.367
I have only
one choice!

00:58:15.372 --> 00:58:19.106
To go, where no
one else exists!

00:58:22.511 --> 00:58:25.078
Beyond the limit!

00:59:20.268 --> 00:59:22.201
Genesect: This place...

00:59:22.203 --> 00:59:23.535
Yes.

00:59:23.537 --> 00:59:26.237
This is the planet
we both come from.

00:59:26.239 --> 00:59:30.107
The planet on which you
and I were created.

00:59:30.109 --> 00:59:33.877
Created because there is
a reason for us to be here...

00:59:35.213 --> 00:59:36.645
The inhabitants
of this planet,

00:59:36.647 --> 00:59:39.514
people and
Pokémon alike,

00:59:39.516 --> 00:59:41.782
live together
as friends.

00:59:41.784 --> 00:59:45.385
Here, we are
all friends.

00:59:45.387 --> 00:59:48.121
You and
I are friends.

00:59:48.123 --> 00:59:52.191
All... friends...

01:00:02.703 --> 01:00:05.203
Let's return...

01:00:09.442 --> 01:00:11.909
to our home!

01:00:22.220 --> 01:00:24.286
Genesect: Mewtwo!

01:00:28.358 --> 01:00:31.525
Return... home...

01:00:45.640 --> 01:00:47.606
- They're falling...
- Pika?

01:00:47.608 --> 01:00:49.874
Iris: Mewtwo and Genesect?

01:00:58.183 --> 01:01:01.784
'Kay, Charizard,
go with them too!

01:01:01.786 --> 01:01:04.186
Char!

01:01:11.928 --> 01:01:13.327
Dragonite!

01:01:13.329 --> 01:01:14.528
You go with
Charizard!

01:01:14.530 --> 01:01:16.363
Dragonite!

01:01:40.288 --> 01:01:42.488
- Dragonite!
- Char!

01:01:52.366 --> 01:01:54.232
- Osha, Osha!
- Sableye, Sableye!

01:01:54.234 --> 01:01:56.367
Axew!

01:02:01.307 --> 01:02:04.574
- Dragonite!
- Charizard!

01:02:06.544 --> 01:02:08.277
- It's no good!
- Then we'll catch them!

01:02:08.279 --> 01:02:09.845
But how do
we do that?

01:02:09.847 --> 01:02:12.848
Some kind of
giant cushion?

01:02:12.850 --> 01:02:14.749
Cushion?

01:02:21.791 --> 01:02:23.557
Feraligatr!

01:02:23.559 --> 01:02:24.758
That's it!

01:02:24.760 --> 01:02:26.392
Pika, Pika!

01:02:26.394 --> 01:02:28.994
- Ralts!
- Sableye!

01:02:49.348 --> 01:02:50.847
- Sawsbuck, Sawsbuck!
- Breloom!

01:02:50.849 --> 01:02:52.748
Deerling!

01:02:55.853 --> 01:02:58.019
Pika!

01:03:01.491 --> 01:03:02.990
- Osha!
- Gatr!

01:03:15.837 --> 01:03:18.037
- I'm all right.
- Osha?

01:03:42.829 --> 01:03:46.030
Everyone on my planet...

01:03:46.032 --> 01:03:47.865
is my friend.

01:03:47.867 --> 01:03:49.933
We're all friends.

01:03:49.935 --> 01:03:51.334
Yeah, that's right!

01:03:51.336 --> 01:03:52.868
Every one of us
is a friend!

01:03:52.870 --> 01:03:54.336
Pikachu!

01:03:54.338 --> 01:03:56.037
Yes, we are
all friends!

01:03:56.039 --> 01:03:57.838
Osha, Osha,
Oshawott!

01:03:57.840 --> 01:03:59.473
Starly, Star, Star, Starly!

01:03:59.475 --> 01:04:01.074
Starly, Starly, Starly!

01:04:01.076 --> 01:04:03.443
Starly, Starly!

01:04:05.113 --> 01:04:08.948
- Axew, Ew!
- Pika!

01:04:14.789 --> 01:04:17.990
Pika?

01:04:17.992 --> 01:04:19.992
It bloomed in
our home...

01:04:22.029 --> 01:04:25.462
I know the place where
they can make a home!

01:04:27.732 --> 01:04:30.532
James: Brilliant!
The sun also rises.

01:04:30.534 --> 01:04:32.901
As surely as night
follows day.

01:04:32.903 --> 01:04:35.970
Call me crazy, but for
some strange reason...

01:04:35.972 --> 01:04:39.173
all: Mornings can be
an absolute blast!

01:04:39.175 --> 01:04:41.108
Starly, Starly, Starly!

01:04:45.547 --> 01:04:47.647
We're safe.

01:04:57.558 --> 01:04:59.658
It looks like
the power's back on!

01:04:59.660 --> 01:05:01.860
Audino!

01:05:09.669 --> 01:05:11.168
Eric: You figured
it out, Ash.

01:05:11.170 --> 01:05:13.003
Good work!

01:05:13.005 --> 01:05:14.838
They say the Panna Lotus
has been around

01:05:14.840 --> 01:05:17.507
for 300 million years.

01:05:17.509 --> 01:05:20.276
That's when the
Genesect were around!

01:05:22.813 --> 01:05:24.112
I like this place!

01:05:24.114 --> 01:05:26.214
- That's great!
- Ew!

01:05:26.216 --> 01:05:28.816
I like you all, too!

01:05:28.818 --> 01:05:30.050
And we like you!

01:05:30.052 --> 01:05:32.185
- Pika, Pika!
- Ew!

01:05:37.959 --> 01:05:39.591
You've got enough
room in this park

01:05:39.593 --> 01:05:41.526
to build the biggest
home in the world!

01:05:41.528 --> 01:05:43.628
Pika, Pika!

01:05:43.630 --> 01:05:45.796
Mewtwo: Ash...

01:05:45.798 --> 01:05:48.799
You found a place for
the Genesect to live.

01:05:48.801 --> 01:05:50.000
Thank you.

01:05:50.002 --> 01:05:52.835
Well, I had
a lot of help!

01:05:54.738 --> 01:05:57.672
I'm glad to have
met you all.

01:05:57.674 --> 01:06:00.141
- I'm glad too!
- Pikachu!

01:06:00.143 --> 01:06:02.143
- So am I!
- Axew!

01:06:02.145 --> 01:06:04.545
A pleasure...

01:06:06.282 --> 01:06:09.216
We'll always
be friends!

01:06:09.218 --> 01:06:11.751
Yes, you're right.

01:06:11.753 --> 01:06:13.986
I trust in
those words, Ash.

01:06:13.988 --> 01:06:17.155
I do now, and will
forevermore!

01:06:28.334 --> 01:06:30.233
Take care of
yourself, Mewtwo.

01:06:30.235 --> 01:06:32.668
- Pika, Pika!
- Maybe someday...

01:06:32.670 --> 01:06:36.038
- We'll meet again.
- Ew, Ew!

01:06:36.040 --> 01:06:38.740
- Count on it!
- Pikachu!

