and lived in our hearts ¶

01:07:40.865 --> 01:07:45.399
¶ We'll have to go
and say hello another day ¶

01:07:45.401 --> 01:07:47.968
¶ We're on our way ¶

01:07:47.970 --> 01:07:51.972
¶ Oh we're
coming home ¶

01:07:51.974 --> 01:07:55.408
¶ The only place
that's never too far ¶

01:07:55.410 --> 01:07:57.209
¶ Oh ¶

01:07:57.211 --> 01:07:59.377
¶ We're coming home ¶

01:07:59.379 --> 01:08:02.346
¶ It's time to listen
to their call ¶

01:08:02.348 --> 01:08:04.348
¶ When adventure
comes our way ¶

01:08:04.350 --> 01:08:10.220
¶ We'll go back
and play ¶

01:08:10.222 --> 01:08:16.392
¶ Oh we're
coming home ¶

01:08:18.195 --> 01:08:20.161
¶ Every journey
starts with ¶

01:08:20.163 --> 01:08:23.363
¶ Friends we
wanna see ¶

01:08:25.667 --> 01:08:27.433
¶ Magic fills
the air in ¶

01:08:27.435 --> 01:08:30.735
¶ Places we've
never been ¶

01:08:32.338 --> 01:08:34.071
¶ We swam
every ocean ¶

01:08:34.073 --> 01:08:36.139
¶ Played in
the sand ¶

01:08:36.141 --> 01:08:37.840
¶ You whistled
a tune ¶

01:08:37.842 --> 01:08:40.242
¶ And everyone
danced ¶

01:08:40.244 --> 01:08:45.145
¶ We'll have to run it's been
such fun around the globe ¶

